4. Send one more `"not json"`. Assert `watcher.wait_closed(PROMPTLY).await == Some(CLOSE_POLICY_VIOLATED)`, then `settle()`.
5. Assert `watcher.of_type_since(received, "error").is_empty()` (junk gets no reply) and `watcher_count == 0`.
6. For `[&w.p1, &w.p2]`, assert `watcher_counts(socket) == vec![json!(0)]`, `socket.of_type("view").is_empty()` and `socket.close_code() == None`.
